A||||6||86SE||How much can the Enduroflex panels take!||||14||
Z||000000||86SE||06-29-2000||02:04 AM||||I have a junk qtr panel that got hit with a base ball bat.  I imagine it got hit pretty hard, it left a small hole and some big cracks in it.  I shot it 3 times with a Daisy 720 PumpMaster BB gun (pumped it 10 times)  and it only chipped the paint off it!!  I was impressed, this gun can leave some pretty nasty chips in a windshield.||||reg||14
